# Dark Matter Naming (No Invector Branding on New Work)

When creating **new** scripts, prefabs, assets, or **repurposing** third-party systems into Dark Matter: Genesis:

- Prefer **`DM`** / **`DMI`** / **`Dm`** prefixes and project-native names (`DMItemCollection`, `DmEvents`, `Cache Lid`, `IO Ancient Cache`).
- Do **not** introduce new identifiers that contain `Invector`, `vItem`, `vTrigger`, or other Invector product branding in **our** `_Project` code, prefabs, animation paths, or UI labels.
- Legacy Invector package files under `Assets/Invector-3rdPersonController/` may remain untouched until a deliberate rename pass; when wrapping or replacing them, ship Dark Matter–named copies/APIs instead of extending Invector names into gameplay.
- Long-term direction: migrate remaining Invector-facing names toward **DMI** / **DM** as systems are touched.

## Examples

| Avoid (new/repurposed) | Prefer |
|---|---|
| `Invector-Chest-cover` | `Cache Lid` |
| `vItemCollection` on project prefabs | `DMItemCollection` |
| `Chest-Open` tied to Invector paths in our assets | `Cache-Lid-Open` under `Assets/_Project/` |
